;; Find entities whose selected node/ref property points to a target page.
;; Tool inputs (JSON): [":user.property/works-at-actual-ident", "\"example company\""]
;; Discover the exact property ident and verify its node/ref type first.
;; Supports cardinality-one/many; matches neither other properties nor ordinary backlinks.
;; Target uses lowercase page name. Returns [entity] rows with UUID and title.
[:find (pull ?b [:block/uuid :block/title])
 :in $ ?property-ident ?page-name
 :where
 [?p :block/name ?page-name]
 [?b ?property-ident ?p]
 [?b :block/title]]
